:"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5138542739","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121954#issuecomment-5138542739","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121954","id":5138542739,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMkfwkw","user":{"login":"Christakou","id":41486691,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNDg2Njkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41486691?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Christakou","html_url":"https://github.com/Christakou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Christakou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Christakou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Christakou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Christakou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Christakou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Christakou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Christakou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Christakou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Christakou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-31T02:25:04Z","updated_at":"2026-07-31T02:25:51Z","body":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/767a49ca-f45d-4da3-afcc-4bebe3dff673\n\nI wasn't sure if this was a bug per-say , but playing around with folding and  indentation for comments seems to indicate that it definitely is. \nI'd expect that folding or not a commented line should be either based on the lines current indent level (in which case the func two() and func three() shouldn't be folded) or based on the indentation level of the next non commented line.\n\n My video shows this is also not how in works in some cases, so as far as I can tell this is indeed a bug.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5138542739/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5141255932","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121954#issuecomment-5141255932","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121954","id":5141255932,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMnFW_A","user":{"login":"amenhany","id":179514017,"node_id":"U_kgDOCrMqoQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179514017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany","html_url":"https://github.com/amenhany","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amenhany/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-31T09:10:35Z","updated_at":"2026-07-31T09:10:35Z","body":"From the video you've shown it seems that it stops folding at the first non-commented line with a lower indent level (not part of func one) *and* also any comments directly above it (func four) that also have a lower indent level.\n\nA potential fix for this would be to check the first commented line at a lower indent level (not just uncommented lines) but that would break any existing GDScripts that have a comment of a lower indent level in the middle of a function implementation.\n\nAlso, this is just speculation I have yet to look at the actual code.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5141255932/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]